<div class="pgs-wrap pgs-shipping">

  <div class="pgs-hero">
    <p class="pgs-eyebrow">Orders &amp; Delivery</p>
    <h1 class="pgs-heading">Shipping</h1>
    <p class="pgs-subhead">We want your cat&rsquo;s new spot to arrive as quickly and reliably as possible.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pgs-content">

    <div class="ship-blocks">

      <div class="ship-block">
        <span class="ship-block__num">01</span>
        <div class="ship-block__body">
          <h2 class="ship-block__title">Processing time</h2>
          <p class="ship-block__text">Orders are processed within 1&ndash;2 business days after payment is confirmed. You&rsquo;ll receive a confirmation email immediately, and a second email with tracking once your order ships.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ship-block">
        <span class="ship-block__num">02</span>
        <div class="ship-block__body">
          <h2 class="ship-block__title">Delivery estimates</h2>
          <p class="ship-block__text">United States: 7&ndash;14 business days from dispatch.<br>Canada: 10&ndash;21 business days from dispatch.<br>These are estimates and may vary depending on carrier volume, region, and seasonal demand.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ship-block">
        <span class="ship-block__num">03</span>
        <div class="ship-block__body">
          <h2 class="ship-block__title">Tracking your order</h2>
          <p class="ship-block__text">As soon as your order ships, you&rsquo;ll receive a tracking number by email. Use it on the carrier&rsquo;s website to follow your package. If your tracking hasn&rsquo;t updated in more than 5 business days, please contact us.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ship-block">
        <span class="ship-block__num">04</span>
        <div class="ship-block__body">
          <h2 class="ship-block__title">Where we ship</h2>
          <p class="ship-block__text">We currently ship to the United States and Canada. If you&rsquo;re located elsewhere and interested, email us &mdash; we&rsquo;re working on expanding our shipping regions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ship-block">
        <span class="ship-block__num">05</span>
        <div class="ship-block__body">
          <h2 class="ship-block__title">Shipping cost</h2>
          <p class="ship-block__text">Shipping is free on all orders. No minimum required, no hidden fees at checkout.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="ship-note">
      <p class="ship-note__label">A note on delays</p>
      <p class="ship-note__text">During busy periods &mdash; holidays, sales events, or carrier disruptions &mdash; delivery times may exceed our estimates. We will always notify you proactively if your order experiences a significant delay. Thank you for your patience.</p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="pgs-cta pgs-cta--border">
    <p class="pgs-cta__text">A question about your order?</p>
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/contact" class="btn btn--secondary">
      Contact support
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19.6293 4.46929C15.1122 2.22992 14.0195 0 14.0195 0V5.05512H0V6.94488H14.0098V12H14.0195C14.0195 12 15.1122 9.75118 19.6293 7.52126C21.0732 6.80315 22.5561 6.33071 24 6C22.5561 5.66929 21.0732 5.19685 19.6293 4.47874V4.46929Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>

</div>

